Package: mxmaps
Type: Package
Title: Create Maps of Mexico
Version: 2020.3.0
Authors@R: c(person("Diego", "Valle-Jones", email = "diego@diegovalle.net", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Maintainer: Diego Valle-Jones <diego@diegovalle.net>
Description: Ready-made functions to create static and interactive choropleths of Mexico.
    Includes functions to manipulate INEGI state and municipio codes along with options to
    customize map appearance through configurable borders, backgrounds, titles and
    optional scale bars.
URL: https://www.diegovalle.net/mxmaps/, https://github.com/diegovalle/mxmaps
BugReports: https://github.com/diegovalle/mxmaps/issues
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
LazyData: TRUE
